==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 90 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between May 20th (11:00am) and June 10th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Drop rates for Uber Rares and Legend Rares doubled!'''}}<br>
In celebration of 90 million downloads, drop rates for Uber Rare and Legend Rare units will be raised to twice the normal chance.<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''From June 3 (11:00AM) until June 10 (10:59AM)!'''}}<br>
Now's your chance to grab that hero that you've been eyeing!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・ Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#0000FF|'''Unit level up and evolution XP costs are 1/2 off for a limited time! Now's your chance to power up units for the battles ahead!'''}}

※ Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Special 90 Million Download Missions!'''}}<br>
New missions have been added to the Catnip Challenges in celebration of 90 million downloads! Clearing all 9 missions will earn you one {{Color|#0000FF|'''Platinum Shard'''}}!<br>
※ 90 Million DL missions are only available until June 10th (10:59am). Be sure to tap the Claim button to receive your reward once the mission has been completed.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Celebration Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
Get awesome rewards from daily Login Stamps!<br>
Earn one stamp each day when you visit the Cat Base menu in The Battle Cats!<br>
You can earn a {{Color|#EA4335|'''total of 4 Rare Tickets and 5 Cat Tickets if you log in every day during the event!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Special 90 Million Downloads Event Stages!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages from The Battle Cats title menu and tap Start! to challenge special stages, available for a limited time only!

※ If event stages do not appear as scheduled, please make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent available version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●90 Million Downloads Celebration Map!'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend/Event Stages to take on the limited map 90M Celebration Gifts Galore! and earn 20 Cat Food upon clearing the stage! After your victory, the stage will disappear, but the stage will reappear once again each day at 12:00am while the event is available!

When the stage reappears, all rewards will become available once again, allowing you to pick up another Cat Food reward every day! Clear the stage once every day to collect a maximum of 440 Cat Food in total.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Monthly Event All-Stars Grateful Gathering'''}}<br>
A super challenge featuring the familiar faces of enemies from Monthly Event stages, gathered together for one tough map! Get a chance to earn up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''30,000,000 XP'''}} by clearing the stage!

Topple these seasonal baddies and earn mountains of XP to power up your Cat Army!

※ After clearing a stage in a Gauntlet map, there will be a cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage in the series.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A during this cooldown period will allow you to immediately challenge the next Gauntlet stage without waiting.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Super tough Limited Invasion Stages appear for one big event!'''}}<br>
Can you topple the biggest bosses of the Special Stages?<br>
Check the schedule below to take on one Limited Invasion stages after another!

{{Color|#0000FF|'''Invasion Event Phase 1:'''}} {{Color|#FF0000|'''May 20th (11:00am) and June 3rd (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
The stages below will appear:<br>
・Invasion Stage: "Clionel Ascendant"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "River Styx"<br>
・Invasion Stage: "King Wahwah's Revenge"<br>
